Package: npthreshold
Type: Package
Title: Non-parametric estimation of the covariate-adjusted threshold-response function
Version: 0.1.2
Author: Lars van der Laan, James Peng
Maintainer: James Peng <jpspeng@gmail.com>
Description: This package implements the non-parametric estimation of the
    covariate-adjusted threshold-response function. More information about
    these methods is provided in the published paper:
    https://academic.oup.com/biometrics/article/79/2/1014/7513933.
